  "body": "Space is the real standout here. Set on a generous 765sqm section with approximately 307sqm of floor area, this substantial 5-bedroom home offers 3 master bedrooms, two generous living areas and plenty of room for everyone. It is an excellent choice for larger or extended families looking for space and quality.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and family area filled with natural light. The dark-toned main kitchen is stylish and practical, with a large island, quality appliances and excellent storage. A separate second kitchen provides additional space for cooking and meal preparation.\r\n\r\nThe separate lounge is another highlight. Its extra-high raked ceiling gives the room a wonderful feeling of openness, making it ideal for relaxing or spending time with family. Sliding doors extend the living space to the outdoor deck, providing an easy setting for entertaining and outdoor dining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are two spacious master bedrooms, each with its own walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Two further bedrooms share the family bathroom. Downstairs, the remaining bedroom is another master suite, also complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, making it ideal for parents, guests or teenagers wanting a little more privacy.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms, including 3 ensuites\r\n• Approximately 307sqm floor area on a generous 765sqm section\r\n• Two spacious living areas\r\n• Extra-high raked ceiling in the separate lounge\r\n• Large kitchen island and a separate second kitchen\r\n• Central air conditioning\r\n• Sunny outdoor deck\r\n\r\nLocated in a popular part of Millwater, the home is within easy reach of schools, parks, beaches, shopping and motorway access.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing or attend our next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
